<!doctype html>
<html lang="bn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Boss AI</title>
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:system-ui;background:#000;color:#fff;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('avatar.jpg') center/cover no-repeat}
.ov{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.6),rgba(0,0,0,.3) 40%,rgba(0,0,0,.9))}
.top{position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px}
.left{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.ava{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #a855f7;object-fit:cover}
.boss{font-weight:900;font-size:22px}.boss span{color:#38bdf8}
.sub{font-size:11px;opacity:.8}
.badge{background:#065f46;border:1px solid #10b981;color:#10b981;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px;font-size:9px;display:inline-block;margin-top:3px}
.on{background:rgba(20,20,30,.8);border:1px solid #333;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 10px;display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center;font-size:11px}
.dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%}
.bubble{position:relative;z-index:2;margin:14px;background:rgba(15,30,60,.9);border:1px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:14px;padding:10px;max-width:68%;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}
.side{position:absolute;right:10px;top:130px;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.sbtn{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;min-width:100px}
.sbtn .ic{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center}
.c1{background:rgba(124,58,237,.25);border-color:#7c3aed;color:#c4b5fd}.c1 .ic{background:#7c3aed}
.c2{background:rgba(59,130,246,.25);border-color:#3b82f6;color:#93c5fd}.c2 .ic{background:#3b82f6}
.c3{background:rgba(16,185,129,.25);border-color:#10b981;color:#6ee7b7}.c3 .ic{background:#10b981}
.c4{background:rgba(249,115,22,.25);border-color:#f97316;color:#fed7aa}.c4 .ic{background:#f97316}
.c5{background:rgba(236,72,153,.25);border-color:#ec4899;color:#fbcfe8}.c5 .ic{background:#ec4899}
.mic{position:absolute;bottom:140px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:2;text-align:center}
.mbtn{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#7c3aed,#1e3a8a);border:3px solid #8b5cf6;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:34px}
.dock{position:absolute;bottom:65px;left:10px;right:10px;z-index:2;background:rgba(10,15,30,.85);border:1px solid #1e293b;border-radius:16px;padding:10px 6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-around}
.ditem{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:9px}
.nav{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:2;background:rgba(0,0,0,.9);border-top:1px solid #1e293b;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:6px 0}
.nitem{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;font-size:9px;color:#64748b}.nitem.active{color:#38bdf8}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg"></div><div class="ov"></div>
<div class="top">
<div class="left"><img src="avatar.jpg" class="ava"><div><div class="boss">Boss <span>AI</span></div><div class="sub">আপনার ব্যক্তিগত AI সহকারী</div><div class="badge">🤖 Android Assistant</div></div></div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:6px"><div class="on"><span class="dot"></span> আমি অনলাইন</div><div style="width:32px;height:32px;background:rgba(20,20,30,.8);border:1px solid #333;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center">⚙️</div></div>
</div>
<div class="bubble">🔊 হ্যালো! আমি BOSS AI<br>আপনার ব্যক্তিগত সহকারী।<br>বলুন, আমি কী করতে পারি?</div>
<div class="side">
<div class="sbtn c1"><span class="ic">💬</span> চ্যাট</div>
<div class="sbtn c2"><span class="ic">🎤</span> ভয়েস কমান্ড</div>
<div class="sbtn c3"><span class="ic">⊞</span> অ্যাপ খুলুন</div>
<div class="sbtn c4"><span class="ic">⚙️</span> সেটিংস</div>
<div class="sbtn c5"><span class="ic">⭐</span> প্রিমিয়াম</div>
</div>
<div class="mic"><div class="mbtn">🎤</div><div style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px;opacity:.7">বলে দেখুন...</div></div>
<div class="dock">
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#ff0000;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">▶️</div>YouTube</div>
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#25D366;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">💬</div>WhatsApp</div>
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#fff;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">▶️</div>Play</div>
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#fff;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">🌐</div>Chrome</div>
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#8b5cf6;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">🖼️</div>গ্যালারি</div>
<div class="ditem"><div style="background:#fff;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center">📷</div>ক্যামেরা</div>
</div>
<div class="nav">
<div class="nitem active"><span>🏠</span>হোম</div>
<div class="nitem"><span>⊞</span>অ্যাপস</div>
<div class="nitem"><span>🧠</span>AI</div>
<div class="nitem"><span>🕒</span>ইতিহাস</div>
<div class="nitem"><span>👤</span>প্রোফাইল</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>